        "note": "SampLib, by Markus de Medeiros. The cited file was added in a single commit on 6 November 2026 (c5eb19be); the repository has 15 commits from 5 to 7 November 2026. It proves that normalised unit exponentials give M! times Lebesgue measure on the open simplex: the same target measure as ratioSqNorm_map_expHalf_pi here, for sampling. It has no projective space or moment map. Read by a reviewer, not compiled.",
